  "priorExpiration": "2016-06-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7007.07 Evidence of Payment Elsewhere. All local exchange telecommunication service providers, other telecommunication service providers, and sellers of prepaid commercial mobile radio service shall be liable for the surcharge unless they can prove to the bureau that a surcharge has been paid to another state.\n\nSource. #9091, eff 2-21-08 (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 7000); amd by #11010, INTERIM, eff 1-1-16, EXPIRES: 6-29-16 (from Saf-C 7007.06); ss by #11128, eff 6-29-16",
